flowchart LR
    A[User Voice] --> B[ASR\nSpeech to Text]
    B --> C[FastAPI\nPOST /api/v1/agent]
    C --> D[Planner\nLocal Mock / Optional LLM]
    D --> E[Structured AgentPlan]
    E --> F[Policy-Constrained Executor]
    F --> G[Status Tools]
    G --> H{Safety Preconditions\nSatisfied?}
    H -- No --> I[Safety Intervention]
    H -- Yes --> J[Action Tools]
    J --> K[Verification Tools]
    K --> L[AgentResponse + Trace]
    I --> L
    L --> M[TTS\nText to Speech]
    M --> A
    G -.-> N[(Mock Home State)]
    J -.-> N
    K -.-> N
